<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container article-body">

    <p>Investors in Indian priced funding rounds routinely ask for the ESOP pool to be topped up as part of the round — and for that top-up to be created <em>pre-money</em>, meaning existing shareholders (largely founders) absorb the dilution, not the incoming investor. This calculator shows the arithmetic behind that ask, using the standard formula for a pre-money pool shuffle.</p>

    <div class="tool-panel">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="esop-invest">New investment amount (₹)</label>
          <input type="number" id="esop-invest" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 20000000" min="0">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="esop-premoney">Headline pre-money valuation (₹)</label>
          <input type="number" id="esop-premoney" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 80000000" min="0">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="esop-existing-pool">Existing ESOP pool already allocated (%)</label>
          <input type="number" id="esop-existing-pool" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 5" min="0" max="100" step="0.1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="esop-target-pool">Target ESOP pool post-round (%)</label>
          <input type="number" id="esop-target-pool" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 12" min="0" max="100" step="0.1">
        </div>
      </div>
      <button type="button" id="esop-calc-btn" class="btn btn-primary mt-24">Calculate Dilution</button>

      <div id="esop-result" class="tool-result">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brass-300)">Estimated post-round cap table</p>
        <div class="tool-result-grid">
          <div class="tool-result-stat"><b id="esop-out-investor">—</b><span>Investor ownership</span></div>
          <div class="tool-result-stat"><b id="esop-out-pool">—</b><span>ESOP pool (post-round)</span></div>
          <div class="tool-result-stat"><b id="esop-out-founders">—</b><span>Founders &amp; existing shareholders</span></div>
          <div class="tool-result-stat"><b id="esop-out-postmoney">—</b><span>Post-money valuation</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="tool-note" id="esop-out-explain"></p>
